import{_ as i,o as n,c as t,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 110 | Realm Refinement · Condensed Origin Realm · Differentiated Cultivation System for Myriad Races","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 110 | Realm Refinement · Condensed Origin Realm · Differentiated Cultivation System for Myriad Races","no":110,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Condensed Origin Realm","Myriad Races","Differentiated Cultivation","Internal Circulation"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","50-Myriad Races Genealogy Overview","52-Alien Classification and Symbiosis","15-Energy Circulation and Transformation Laws"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0110_模块1-凝元境-万族差异化修炼体系.md","filePath":"en/0110_模块1-凝元境-万族差异化修炼体系.md"}'),o={name:"en/0110_模块1-凝元境-万族差异化修炼体系.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,d,u){return n(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-110-condensed-origin-realm-differentiated-cultivation-system-for-myriad-races" tabindex="-1">Entry 110 | Condensed Origin Realm: Differentiated Cultivation System for Myriad Races <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-110-condensed-origin-realm-differentiated-cultivation-system-for-myriad-races" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 110 | Condensed Origin Realm: Differentiated Cultivation System for Myriad Races&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 50, 52, 15</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-internal-circulation-is-not-humanity-s-circulation" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Internal circulation is not humanity&#39;s circulation <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-internal-circulation-is-not-humanity-s-circulation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Internal circulation is not humanity&#39;s circulation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Sense Origin Realm (Entry 103) was about perceiving in &quot;one realm, myriad methods&quot;; entering the Condensed Origin Realm, differentiation deepens from &quot;how to perceive&quot; to &quot;how to bank, how to turn.&quot; Carbon-based life&#39;s internal circulation runs through meridians and flesh; energy life&#39;s internal circulation is field self-rotation; mechanical life&#39;s &quot;circulation&quot; is topological closure of energy circuits — the same name Condensed Origin Realm, but the &quot;circulation&quot; inside each race is fundamentally not the same thing. Using a single species&#39; circulation standard to measure all Myriad Races is itself the greatest energy waste.</p><p>The six top-level axioms are the legislative foundation of Myriad Race differentiation: the anti-predation axiom — each race&#39;s condensation draws energy only from cosmic circulation, never devouring others&#39; origin; the republican axiom of Myriad Races — equal evolutionary qualification regardless of genealogy; the collective ascension axiom — each race&#39;s internal circulation must feed back into civilization, eliminating talent underuse; the causal self-discipline axiom — cross-race co-cultivation respects others&#39; causal boundaries; the law-first axiom — the legal framework of the Myriad Race Condensed differentiation system is stable and self-consistent, never rewritten for plot convenience, and infinitely expandable without collapse; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-condensed-origin-realm-differences-across-five-genealogies" tabindex="-1">I. Condensed Origin Realm Differences Across Five Genealogies <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-condensed-origin-realm-differences-across-five-genealogies" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Condensed Origin Realm Differences Across Five Genealogies&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per the Myriad Races Genealogy Overview (Document 50) and Document 14, each race&#39;s &quot;condensation-internal circulation&quot; form in the Condensed Origin Realm is naturally different:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Genealogy</th><th>Representative groups</th><th>Condensed Realm features</th><th>Internal circulation form</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Carbon-based material</td><td>Humans, beasts, wood tribe</td><td>Condensation relies on physical bearing, circulation runs through meridians and blood</td><td>Biological circulation, needs time to nurture</td></tr><tr><td>Energy condensation</td><td>Spirits, elemental life</td><td>Innate energy bodies, condensation near instinct, difficulty is &quot;not overflowing&quot;</td><td>Field self-rotation, needs contraction</td></tr><tr><td>Mechanical construction</td><td>Machine tribe, mechanical life</td><td>Achieves &quot;circulation&quot; via energy circuit topology, high precision</td><td>Circuit/pipeline closure, recomputable</td></tr><tr><td>Consciousness information</td><td>Consciousness entities, higher-dimensional beings</td><td>Condensation is &quot;condensing consciousness density,&quot; circulation is self-consistent information loops</td><td>Logical loops, prone to dead loops</td></tr><tr><td>Hybrid variation</td><td>Cross-plane half-bloods, exotic life</td><td>Starting points vary wildly, must be case-assessed</td><td>Compatibility first, reject forcing</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The Condensed Realm version of the &quot;substance over name&quot; principle: the unified standard assesses &quot;whether a sustainable, high-purity, deployable internal circulation system has been built,&quot; not the specific material of the circulation.</p><h2 id="ii-paths-for-each-race-circulation-takes-its-own-form" tabindex="-1">II. Paths for Each Race: Circulation Takes Its Own Form <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-paths-for-each-race-circulation-takes-its-own-form" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Paths for Each Race: Circulation Takes Its Own Form&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Beast tribe: with bloodline rhythm as the ring; Condensed Realm is &quot;taming wild energy, letting surging blood learn to self-rotate&quot;</li><li>Wood tribe: with annual-ring growth as the ring; condensation extremely slow but extremely stable; a hundred-year circulation also meets standard</li><li>Spirit tribe: with field contraction as the ring; Condensed Realm emphasizes &quot;contraction,&quot; preventing innate energy self-overflow into disaster</li><li>Machine tribe: with circuit closure as the ring; Condensed Realm is &quot;completing topology verification,&quot; circulation precisely recomputable</li><li>Consciousness tribe: with logical self-consistency as the ring; the biggest pitfall in the Condensed Realm is &quot;dead loops&quot; — cognitively self-consistent closure with no new input</li></ul><h2 id="iii-cross-race-co-cultivation-civilizational-flow-of-circulation-experience" tabindex="-1">III. Cross-Race Co-Cultivation: Civilizational Flow of Circulation Experience <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-cross-race-co-cultivation-civilizational-flow-of-circulation-experience" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Cross-Race Co-Cultivation: Civilizational Flow of Circulation Experience&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Myriad Race differentiation does not mean each cultivates alone:</p><ul><li>Cross-race mentors: machine mentors help human students verify circulation topology; spirit mentors help beast students contract energy overflow — this is the grassroots form of the Myriad Race origin two-way circulation</li><li>Half-blood compatibility: half-bloods and exotic life go through the system compatibility assessment case channel, eliminating &quot;race labeling&quot;</li><li>Equal certification: realm certification recognizes only circulation substance, not birth</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-racial-narrow-mindedness-is-the-welfare-ceiling" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison: Racial Narrow-Mindedness is the Welfare Ceiling <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-racial-narrow-mindedness-is-the-welfare-ceiling" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison: Racial Narrow-Mindedness is the Welfare Ceiling&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Tang-Luo-style old-era universal welfare system (discussed in Entry 103) refused even non-human &quot;perception&quot; within &quot;universal welfare,&quot; let alone helping beasts tame blood or spirits contract. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer: the Condensed Realm is not humanity&#39;s backyard for banking, but a construction site where all Myriad Races co-build circulation — 99% coverage, not a single race missing.</p><h2 id="v-cross-realm-handover-how-each-race-s-internal-circulation-connects-to-transform-origin-conversion" tabindex="-1">V. Cross-Realm Handover: How Each Race&#39;s Internal Circulation Connects to Transform-Origin Conversion <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-cross-realm-handover-how-each-race-s-internal-circulation-connects-to-transform-origin-conversion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Cross-Realm Handover: How Each Race&#39;s Internal Circulation Connects to Transform-Origin Conversion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Each race&#39;s internal circulation built in the Condensed Realm varies in form; entering the Transform Realm, each must go through its own conversion interface. The beast tribe&#39;s bloodline circulation connects to &quot;wild burst conversion&quot;; the wood tribe&#39;s annual-ring circulation connects to &quot;growth energy conversion&quot;; the spirit tribe&#39;s field circulation connects to &quot;elemental interconversion&quot;; the machine tribe&#39;s circuit circulation connects to &quot;energy-compute conversion&quot;; the consciousness tribe&#39;s logical circulation connects to &quot;energy-information encoding.&quot; The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization does not force all races to use the same circulation to run the Transform Realm&#39;s unified craft, but opens each race&#39;s exclusive conversion interface protocol — this is precisely the &quot;substance over name&quot; principle landing at cross-realm handover. What to guard against: half-blood individuals of each race are most prone to problems at this handover; if two circulation forms are uncoordinated, they fight each other when entering transformation; system compatibility assessment must be done in advance to design a dual-circulation coordination plan.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li>Anti-energy waste: each race&#39;s circulation form is a scarce resource; using a single standard is the greatest misuse of talent</li><li>Anti-predation: all races&#39; condensation is based on circulation and symbiosis, none on devouring other races&#39; origin</li><li>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison: racially narrow universal welfare is not welfare, but patronage</li><li>Myriad Races full coverage: five genealogies + exotic life + multiverse residual civilizations all within the Condensed Realm&#39;s 99% coverage</li><li>Hyper-multiverse full openness: each race&#39;s Condensed Realm methods are openly shared, the second link of the fully open chain is race-blind</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Condensed Realm&#39;s Myriad Race panorama proves: circulation forms can be billions, but the direction of circulation is one — connect outward, feed back to civilization. When every race turns its internal circulation in the way it is best at, the symbiotic cosmos of Myriad Races moves from &quot;allowing difference&quot; to &quot;needing difference.&quot;</p><p>In the final analysis, the Condensed Realm Myriad Race differentiated cultivation system described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./50-万族谱系总览.html">50-Myriad Races Genealogy Overview</a> · <a href="./52-异族分类与共生.html">52-Alien Classification and Symbiosis</a> · <a href="./15-能量循环与转化法则.html">15-Energy Circulation and Transformation Laws</a></li></ul>',25)])])}const f=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,f as default};
